        }
      }
    },
    "Text found in images is indexed on this Mac only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画像内のテキストはこの Mac 上でのみインデックスされます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's it — this opens Nori anywhere": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これで完了 — どこからでも Nori を開けます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel follows the system appearance and accent color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パネルはシステムの外観モードとアクセントカラーに従います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pattern doesn't compile, so it is ignored": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このパターンは無効なため無視されます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This shortcut types “%@”, so it won't work in password fields": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このショートカットは “%@” を入力するため、パスワード欄では使えません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Truncated": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "省略あり"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今すぐ試してみましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the menu bar icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メニューバーアイコンの下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピン留めを解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until I Resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再開するまで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バージョン %1$@ (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ようこそ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nori": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nori へようこそ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nori 👋 Press ↩ to paste this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nori へようこそ 👋 ↩ を押してこれをペーストしてみましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you pick a clip, Nori presses ⌘V in the app you were using. macOS calls this permission Accessibility. Nori has no network access and stores clips only on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリップを選ぶと、Nori は直前に使っていたアプリで ⌘V を押します。macOS ではこの権限を「アクセシビリティ」と呼びます。Nori はネットワークにアクセスせず、クリップはこの Mac にのみ保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, open Settings with ⌘, inside the panel": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非表示の場合はパネル内で ⌘, を押して設定を開きます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, ↩ copies the clip instead of pasting. You can turn this on later in Settings › General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "許可がない場合、↩ はペーストの代わりにクリップをコピーします。あとから 設定 › 一般 で有効にできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this any time in Settings › General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定 › 一般 でいつでも変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld clip](inflect: true) and ^[%lld pinned clip](inflect: true) will be removed. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 件のクリップとピン留めした %2$lld 件を削除します。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld clip](inflect: true) will be removed, including ^[%lld pinned clip](inflect: true). This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピン留めした %2$lld 件を含む %1$lld 件のクリップを削除します。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld clip](inflect: true) will be removed. Pinned clips are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件のクリップを削除します。ピン留めしたクリップは残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld clip](inflect: true) will be removed. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件のクリップを削除します。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld clip](inflect: true) will be removed. ^[%lld pinned clip](inflect: true) will stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 件のクリップを削除します。ピン留めした %2$lld 件は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld item](inflect: true) not saved today": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日は %lld 件が未保存"
          }
        }
